<navigation-bar title="家庭食谱与菜单" back="{{false}}" color="#2d2623" background="transparent"><view slot="left" class="nav-circle" bindtap="goBack"><view class="back-icon"></view></view></navigation-bar>
<scroll-view class="menu-scroll" scroll-y enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="page-shell no-tabs menu-page">
  <view class="menu-hero ui-card"><view><text>{{babyName}} · {{ageText}}</text><text>从已发布食谱中筛选当前月龄候选</text></view><view class="candidate-count">{{candidates.length}}<text>项</text></view></view>
  <view class="boundary-card"><text>{{notice}}</text><text>{{caregiverNotice}}；候选不会自动记为实际摄入。</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="state-panel ui-card"><text class="state-panel-title">暂时无法读取菜单</text><text class="state-panel-desc">{{error}}</text><button class="secondary-button" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="section-heading"><text class="section-title">今日候选</text><text wx:if="{{excludedCount}}">已按月龄或家庭避免食材排除 {{excludedCount}} 项</text></view>
    <block wx:if="{{candidates.length}}"><view class="candidate-card ui-card" wx:for="{{candidates}}" wx:key="recipeRevisionId" bindtap="explainCandidate"><view class="candidate-badge">候</view><view class="candidate-copy"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.ageLabel}} · {{item.ingredientCount}} 种标准食材</text></view><view class="status-pill">可选</view></view></block>
    <view wx:else class="empty-card ui-card"><text>暂无符合当前月龄的已发布食谱</text><text>家庭草稿不会进入候选；发布或调整家庭避免食材后可再次查看。</text></view>
    <view class="section-heading"><text class="section-title">家庭食谱</text><text>{{recipes.length}} 项 · 只读展示</text></view>
    <block wx:if="{{recipes.length}}"><view class="recipe-card ui-card" wx:for="{{recipes}}" wx:key="recipeId"><view class="recipe-top"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="recipe-status {{item.status === 'PUBLISHED' ? 'published' : ''}}">{{item.statusLabel}}</text></view><text>{{item.description || '暂无说明'}}</text><view class="recipe-meta"><text>修订 {{item.revision || '—'}}</text><text>{{item.weightLabel}}</text></view><text wx:if="{{item.status === 'DRAFT'}}" class="recipe-hint">草稿仅供查看，不会进入今日候选</text></view></block>
    <view wx:if="{{!recipes.length}}" class="empty-card ui-card"><text>还没有家庭食谱</text><text>食谱建立与发布属于管理功能，不会由菜单候选自动完成。</text></view>
    <view class="section-heading"><text class="section-title">家庭避免食材</text><text>非医学禁忌</text></view>
    <view class="avoidance-row ui-card" wx:for="{{avoidances}}" wx:key="foodId"><text>{{item.foodName}}</text><text>{{item.reason || '家庭主动避免'}}</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{!avoidances.length}}" class="empty-card compact ui-card"><text>当前未设置家庭避免食材</text></view>
  </block>
</view></scroll-view>
